sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant T as TUI_View
    participant C as CaptureService
    participant DB as libSQL_DB
    participant G as GeminiAdapter

    U->>T: Enters capture text manually
    T->>C: createCapture(text)
    C->>DB: save(capture)
    DB-->>C: returns saved capture
    C-->>T: capture created
    
    U->>T: Requests definition (selects prompt)
    T->>C: generateDefinition(captureId, promptId)
    C->>DB: getCapture and getPrompt
    DB-->>C: returns data
    
    loop Retry up to 3 times
        C->>G: sendPrompt(text, prompt)
        alt Success
            G-->>C: returns definition text
        else Network Error
            G-->>C: throws Error
        end
    end
    
    C->>DB: save(definition)
    DB-->>C: ok
    C-->>T: definition generation complete
    T-->>U: Updates UI with new definition
